From: mogwai-db <https://github.com/bodar/mogwai-db>
Subject: [PATCH] gremlin-javascript: put "types" first in every exports condition

Export conditions are matched IN ORDER, so a "types" condition placed after "import"/"require" is
dead: TypeScript resolves "." (and "./language", "./io") through the earlier condition, gets the
.js, and never sees the .d.ts. Every consumer on moduleResolution node16/nodenext/bundler therefore
resolves the client as untyped, silently — the declarations are built and shipped, they are just
unreachable through the exports map. esbuild reports it directly:

  ▲ [WARNING] The condition "types" here will never be used as it comes after both "import" and
    "require" [package.json]

Node's own documentation states the rule: "types" must come first. See
https://nodejs.org/api/packages.html#community-conditions-definitions.

The top-level "types" field (line 22) is what currently rescues most consumers, but it is the
LEGACY path — it is ignored entirely once "exports" is present under node16/nodenext, which is the
default for any package that is itself "type": "module".

This moves the condition rather than restructuring the map, so behaviour for import/require is
byte-identical.

Note for a follow-up (deliberately NOT in this patch): "." is dual — ESM and CJS — and both arms
currently share one ESM-flavoured .d.ts. Strictly that wants per-condition types
("import": { "types": …, "default": … }, "require": { "types": …, "default": … }) with a .d.cts
built for the CJS arm. That needs a build change; this patch fixes the resolution bug on its own.
---
 gremlin-js/gremlin-javascript/package.json | 12 ++++++------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gremlin-js/gremlin-javascript/package.json b/gremlin-js/gremlin-javascript/package.json
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/gremlin-js/gremlin-javascript/package.json
+++ b/gremlin-js/gremlin-javascript/package.json
@@ -26,17 +26,17 @@
   },
   "exports": {
     ".": {
+      "types": "./build/esm/index.d.ts",
       "import": "./build/esm/index.js",
-      "require": "./build/cjs/index.cjs",
-      "types": "./build/esm/index.d.ts"
+      "require": "./build/cjs/index.cjs"
     },
     "./language": {
-      "import": "./build/esm/language/index.js",
-      "types": "./build/esm/language/index.d.ts"
+      "types": "./build/esm/language/index.d.ts",
+      "import": "./build/esm/language/index.js"
     },
     "./io": {
-      "import": "./build/esm/structure/io/binary/GraphBinary.js",
-      "types": "./build/esm/structure/io/binary/GraphBinary.d.ts"
+      "types": "./build/esm/structure/io/binary/GraphBinary.d.ts",
+      "import": "./build/esm/structure/io/binary/GraphBinary.js"
     }
   },
   "typesVersions": {
